    },
    {
      "displayText": "This Holovator’s been on the fritz recently...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200048006F006C006F007600610074006F0072201900730020006200650065006E0020006F006E002000740068006500200066007200690074007A00200072006500630065006E0074006C0079002E002E002E001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can usually get it up and running again with a\nwell-placed punch or two...but not this time.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMaybe it needs a bigger wallop than I can give.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 150
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Looks like we’re going to need a Pokémon’s help\nto kick this thing into action!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon have two categories of attacking moves,\nyou know: physical and special.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou can check a move’s category from the same\nscreen you’d use to change a Pokémon’s moves.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe icon for physical moves will look like a burst\nof spikes—that’s what we’re looking for!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 274
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If a Pokémon gave this Holovator a wallop with a\nFighting-type physical move, I think that’d fix it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If a Pokémon hits this Holovator with a Fighting-\ntype physical move, that should get it working!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, that won’t work. We need to hit the Holovator\nwith a Fighting-type physical move!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! It’s working again!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006800210020004900742019007300200077006F0072006B0069006E006700200061006700610069006E0021001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I knew a Fighting-type physical move would do it!\nNothing like a good thwack to fix things up!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You sure this machine’s OK?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200073007500720065002000740068006900730020006D0061006300680069006E0065201900730020004F004B003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That seems a bit...violent",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100740020007300650065006D0073002000610020006200690074002E002E002E00760069006F006C0065006E00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s fiiine! Trust me!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200066006900690069006E006500210020005400720075007300740020006D00650021001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is how we fix all our electrical appliances at\nthe dojo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680069007300200069007300200068006F0077002000770065002000660069007800200061006C006C0020006F0075007200200065006C0065006300740072006900630061006C0020006100700070006C00690061006E006300650073002000610074000A00740068006500200064006F006A006F0021001000020114015A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Anyway, thanks a bunch! This Holovator would’ve\nbeen stuck without you!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŚ",
